> `24-44`: **Add verification checks before deleting source files.**
> 
> The script deletes original PNG files immediately after Sharp processing without verifying that:
> 1. The WebP file was successfully created
> 2. The WebP file has non-zero size
> 3. The WebP file is readable/valid
