> `42-42`: **Wrap file deletion in try/catch for resilience.**
> 
> The `fs.unlinkSync` call is not wrapped in error handling. If deletion fails (file locked, permissions issue, disk error), the entire script exits without processing remaining files, potentially failing CI unnecessarily.
> 
> Given the PR's objective to "make verification pipeline fully green" and CI hardening, this operation should be more resilient.
